
@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam SequenceMessageAlign center
scale 0.9

actor User
participant "Node Editor" as Editor
participant "Reactive Engine\n(RxPy + Qt loop)" as Rx
participant "Node A\n(e.g., EEGFilter)" as A
participant "Node B\n(e.g., FeatureExtractor)" as B
participant "Visual Sink\n(EEGLiveDisplay)" as Sink

User -> Editor: Edit parameter
Editor -> Rx: onChange(pin, value)
Rx -> A: set_input(...)\nBehaviorSubject next(value)
A -> A: execute()
A --> Rx: emit(outA)

alt dependent input changed
  Rx -> B: set_input(outA)
  B -> B: execute()
  B --> Rx: emit(outB)
else unchanged inputs
  Rx -> B: skip recompute\n(last-value cache)
end

Rx -> Sink: set_input(out*)\n(throttle)
Sink -> Sink: redraw()

note right of Rx
Deterministic propagation
along graph edges
end note

note right of Sink
Gentle throttling keeps
UI smooth during rapid edits
end note

note bottom
Streams: MNE Raw/Epochs or batch;
All pins are BehaviorSubjects
end note
@enduml
